# Keep the build context small and free of host-specific / secret material.
# The Dockerfiles install dependencies and generate the Prisma client from
# scratch, so anything built or downloaded on the host is deliberately excluded.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/generated
**/*.tsbuildinfo

.git
.github
.vscode
.idea

# Secrets — never in an image. `.env.example` files are the only ones kept.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Test / tooling output
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/blob-report
*.log
.DS_Store

# Docs and local infra are not needed to build the images
docs
docker-compose.yml
docker-compose.prod.yml
*.md
